# Sao chep file nay thanh .env roi dien API key that vao (KHONG commit .env).
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Lay key tai: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# key1 -> phien Sensei (Gemini Live: giang bai, doi thoai truc tiep qua audio)
# key2 -> dan dien vien long tieng + soan de (goi model van ban, tao giong doc)
# key3, key4 -> du phong. Dien duoc toi da 4 key (4 tai khoan khac nhau);
#   khi soan de bang AI het quota (429) tren mot key, app tu dong xoay sang
#   key ke tiep con trong danh sach; dan dien vien long tieng cung xoay key
#   tuong tu sau khi da thu het cac model du phong.
#
# Cac key co the trung nhau (dung chung 1-2 key cho moi vai tro) hoac tach
# rieng moi vai 1 tai khoan de chia tai quota. Chi can dien it nhat 1 key —
# cac o con lai de trong cung duoc, code se tu bo qua o rong.
GEMINI_KEY1=
GEMINI_KEY2=
GEMINI_KEY3=
GEMINI_KEY4=
#
# ---- Ban mo cong khai (production tren VPS) ----
# PROXY_MODE=1: server.py KHONG phat key that trong env.js nua; trinh duyet chi
#   nhan "o" @1..@4 kem restBase=/gl, wsBase=/glws. Can chay kem gl_proxy.py
#   (pip install -r requirements-proxy.txt) de doi o -> key that phia may chu.
PROXY_MODE=
# BASIC_AUTH=user:pass -> server.py bat dang nhap HTTP Basic cho ca trang
#   (dung khi mo ra internet ma khong co lop bao ve khac). De trong = tat.
BASIC_AUTH=
# ALLOWED_HOSTS: ten mien cong khai duoc phep lay env.js (cach nhau dau phay),
#   vd ten mien cua ban. KHONG de '*' (se lo key o che do khong PROXY_MODE).
ALLOWED_HOSTS=
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS: origin duoc phep goi gl_proxy.py (cach nhau dau phay),
#   vd https://ten-mien-cua-ban. Doc boi gl_proxy.py.
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=
# GL_PORT: cong nghe cua gl_proxy.py (mac dinh 3001, chi nghe 127.0.0.1).
GL_PORT=
